{"id": "21-397-2-9", "zh": "所谓的顺世论（lokāyata），应知就是诡辩之论（vitaṇḍasattha）；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-398-2-9", "zh": "而仪轨论（keṭubha）是讲仪式与作法规程、对诗人有益的论书。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-400-2-7", "zh": "传记（ākhyāyikā）是取材于实有事迹的作品；故事（kathā）是构思编撰而成的作品；", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-401-2-10", "zh": "刑罚论（daṇḍanīti）就是治世论（atthasattha）；消息（vuttanta）与 pavatti 同义。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-403-2-13", "zh": "saññā、akhyā、avhā、samaññā、abhidhāna、nāma、avhaya，", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-404-2-9", "zh": "nāmadheyya、adhivacana，都是“名称”的意思；回答则称为 paṭivākya、uttara。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-406-2-10", "zh": "问题称为 pañha（三性通用）、anuyoga、pucchā；又，nidassana、", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-407-2-10", "zh": "upogghāta、diṭṭhanta，以及 udāharaṇa，都是“例证”的意思。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-409-2-9", "zh": "saṅkhepa、saṃhāra、samāsa、saṅgaha 是同义词，都指“概要”；", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-410-2-8", "zh": "像“你欠了一百”之类的不实之言，称为诬告（abbhakkhāna）。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-412-2-10", "zh": "诉讼称为 vohāra、vivāda；发誓称为 sapana，也称为 sapatha；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-413-2-5", "zh": "名声称为 yasa、siloka、kitti（阴性），", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-414-2-6", "zh": "宣告称为 ghosanā、uccasaddana。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-416-2-9", "zh": "回声称为 paṭighosa、paṭirava；开场白称为 upaññāsa、vacīmukha；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-417-2-11", "zh": "katthanā、silāghā、vaṇṇanā、nuti、thuti，", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-419-2-18", "zh": "以及 thomana［异读：thomanaṃ vā，有的版本说 thomana 与 thomanā 两性通用］、pasaṃsā，都是“称赞”的意思；孔雀的鸣叫称为 kekā；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-420-2-6", "zh": "大象的吼叫称为 koñcanāda；", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-421-2-5", "zh": "马的嘶鸣则称为 hesā。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-423-2-9", "zh": "同义词称为 pariyāya、vevacana；交谈称为 sākacchā、saṃkathā；", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-424-2-11", "zh": "upavāda、upakkosa、vaṇṇavāda、anuvāda，", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-425-2-9", "zh": "janavāda、apavāda、parivāda，意思都相同，都指“非议”。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-427-2-11", "zh": "khepa、nindā、kucchā、jigucchā、garahā，都是“指责”的意思；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-428-2-7", "zh": "以指责开头的责难（upārambha），称为 paribhāsana。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-430-2-7", "zh": "依照不恰当、不高尚的说法而说出的话，", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-431-2-8", "zh": "称为 abhivākya，这种话显露出越轨之处。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-433-2-9", "zh": "反复说同样的话称为 anulāpa；无意义的话称为 palāpa；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-434-2-4", "zh": "最初的招呼称为 ālāpa，", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-435-2-5", "zh": "哀叹称为 vilāpa、paridava。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-437-2-8", "zh": "自相矛盾的话称为 vippalāpa；传话称为 sandesavutti、vācika；", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-438-2-8", "zh": "彼此之间没有矛盾的交谈，称为 sambhāsana、sallāpa。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-440-2-8", "zh": "粗恶的话称为 pharusa、niṭṭhura；悦耳的话称为 manuñña、hadayaṅgama；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-441-2-8", "zh": "前后矛盾的话称为 saṃkula、kiliṭṭha。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-443-2-14", "zh": "缺乏整体意义的话，称为 abaddha［异读：abandha（ka 本）］；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-444-2-19", "zh": "虚假的话称为 vitatha、musā［异读：āhataṃ tu musātthakaṃ（有的版本，见《阿摩罗字库》）］；pharusa 等词是三性通用的。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-446-2-9", "zh": "sammā（不变词）、avitatha、sacca、taccha、yathātatha，都是“真实”的意思；", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-447-2-11", "zh": "具有这些意思的词三性通用；alīka 也是如此；sacca、micchā、musā 则可作不变词。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "21-449-2-7", "zh": "rava、ninnāda、ninada、sadda、", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-450-2-7", "zh": "nigghosa、nāda、dhani、rāva、", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-451-2-6", "zh": "ārāva、saṃrāva、virāva、ghosa、", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-452-2-7", "zh": "rava、suti（阴性）、sara、nissana，都是“声音”的意思。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-454-2-8", "zh": "清晰、柔美、易懂、悦耳、不散漫、", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-455-2-9", "zh": "圆润集中、深沉、有回响——这就是具足八种特质的声音。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-457-2-7", "zh": "畜生类的叫声，称为 ruta、vassita；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-458-2-4", "zh": "喧闹声称为 kolāhala、kalahala，", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-459-2-5", "zh": "歌曲称为 gīta、gāna、gītikā。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-461-2-9", "zh": "音有七种，音阶（gāma）有三种，转调（mucchanā）有二十一种，", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-462-2-13", "zh": "音型（tāna）［异读：ṭhānāni（多数版本）］有四十九种，这些合称为音律体系。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-464-2-9", "zh": "usabha、dhevata、chajja、gandhāra、majjhima、", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-465-2-11", "zh": "pañcama 和 nisāda，这些称为七音。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-467-2-10", "zh": "牛发出 usabha 音，马同样发出 dhevata 音；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-468-2-10", "zh": "孔雀发出 chajja 音，山羊发出 gandhāra 音，鹤发出 majjhima 音。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-470-2-9", "zh": "杜鹃等发出 pañcama 音，大象则发出 nisāda 音；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-471-2-6", "zh": "chajja、majjhima，", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-472-2-6", "zh": "以及 **sādhāraṇa**，这三种是音阶。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-474-2-10", "zh": "在这些音中，每一个音各有三种转调；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-475-2-15", "zh": "音型［异读：ṭhānāni（多数版本）］也是如此，每一个音可得七种。", "confidence": 65}
